ntdll: Work around Steam in process creation.

KITSUNE_STEAM_LEAN ends Steam's web helper while a game runs and refuses
new ones until it exits. The web helper gets its flags (software
rendering with KITSUNE_FORCE_SWRAST), some helpers are skipped, and
steamservice runs through cmd.exe. spawn_process is also where a child
becomes threaded (0006), and ios_process_exit_state reports its exit.
Fixes a leak in build_argv.
